cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Navigable Affordance RSA"
abstract: >
  RSA pipeline testing whether the human occipital place area (OPA)
  encodes the topological structure of navigable space, above and beyond
  the 2017 navigational-affordance model of Bonner & Epstein and low-level
  visual cortex. Uses SAM-based floor segmentation to extract an
  8-dimensional Gibsonian affordance vector from each scene photograph.
authors:
